  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed two storey side extension and provision of a pitched roof over the existing single storey rear extension, by reason of its size, bulk, appearance and position extending to the back of footpath line would constitute an obtrusive feature infilling this prominent open corner. It would be out of character with this property and those adjoining and would cause harm to the living conditions of neighbouring properties and the appearance  of the area generally. It would therefore be contrary to policies ENV B.1.1 (All New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of the Adopted UDP and the Residential Extensions Guidelines."
